  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Rohy: Supporting and expanding existing health and environmental network</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Generating Ideas proposal will take place in one of the poorest regions of Madagascar. Infant mortality rates in Madagascar are very high, and there is a specific unmet need for family planning services. There have also been huge cuts to health service funding. The consultation planned will gather more detailed information on the priorities of families and service provision gaps. It will explore how to harness partnerships with existing environmental networks, in order to develop an integrated Population Health and Environment model. This will be used to plan a programme of work to improve access to services.</narrative>
  </description>
